        "wrong": "am having",
        "right": "have",
        "type": "style","explanation_hindi": "अनुभव बताने के लिए 'have' का प्रयोग अधिक पेशेवर है।"
      }
    ]
  }

{
    "corrected": "I have been working at this company since 2019.","mistakes": [
      {
        "wrong": "I am working",
        "right": "I have been working",
        "type": "grammar","explanation_hindi": "समय अवधि बताने के लिए Present Perfect Continuous का उपयोग करें।"
      },
      {
        "wrong": "in this company",
        "right": "at this company",
        "type": "style","explanation_hindi": "कंपनी के संदर्भ में 'at' का उपयोग अधिक पेशेवर है।"
      }
    ]
  }

{
